    "body": "There are two issues here:\r\n 1) Drag a file/directory to the shortcut link will start the program in console mode. This is not what a user expect. The program should start in windows mode.\r\n 2) The torrent file can not be read by the program for some unknown reason. I do not know what is wrong with this torrent file. Can the torrent file be open by other torrent programs? Or by tracker editor in 'normal' windows mode?\r\n\r\nI will fix start in 'normal' windows mode at drag/drop to 'shortcut'",
